{"data":{"body":"[P2] Do not permanently promote these errors after one failed or `RUNNING` status read. During the completion race being handled, the callback endpoint can close the token before `GetDurableExecution` exposes the terminal state; clearing the candidates prevents the next complete terminal history from reconciling them and produces a spurious callback failure. Keep them pending until terminal history or polling termination, and add failed/RUNNING-then-terminal regression cases.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABAgNuGg","finding_digest":"790d526666d36eb56bfb8b03f8d4024211629140978f96c671279e77f41bcbf4","finding_id":"arf_v1_pegveztg2nxlk273rmb7rvacii","finding_key":"validate.py::pollingvalidator.validate::callback-round-stop-conditions","identity_key":"validate.py::pollingvalidator.validate::callback-round-stop-conditions","line":836,"observation_digest":"37d8ea240bbfe9c683da49e85ccbcb3e9d6d7831a2477e97b5e735422895aa8b","observation_id":"aro_v1_g7moujalx7u4na62jhufzs6lh2","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests/validate.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_pegveztg2nxlk273rmb7rvacii","published_at":"2026-10-20T18:33:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_rai3pf6sqzfzwf22lvxugd67mb","reviewed_base_sha":"2387bb48968f7420ddf55aaf6dc83a9f15778332","reviewed_head_sha":"e0040db8942a4d49b1950be496fb30cbc72ed71c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":832,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":142},"record_id":"art_v1_zvtmeiwbea7yfjfirwpmm6h5gn","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-20T18:33:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
